SUMMARY:Art in Virtual Motion
DESCRIPTION:Embark on an extraordinary journey where art meets technology and challenges become opportunities for creativity. In this immersive workshop\, participants dive into a unique experience that blends virtual reality technology with open-ended artistic exploration. Designed to break away from traditional boundaries\, the workshop ignites creativity and encourages bold experimentation. Participants enter a virtual artistic space that invites them to explore\, collaborate and take on creative challenges&mdash\;leading to the creation of innovative artworks that go beyond the familiar and open new horizons of imagination.
